            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.033,
                0.545,
                0.565,
                0.564
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 构成乙酰胆碱受体离子通道的 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\alpha"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 、 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\beta"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 、 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\gamma"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 和 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\delta"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " 亚基属于同源蛋白。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.033,
                0.569,
                0.406,
                0.587
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3. 具有手性碳原子的化合物一定具有旋光性。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.033,
                0.593,
                0.388,
                0.61
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4. 蛋白质、DNA 和 RNA 都具有高级结构。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 16,
              "bbox": [
                0.033,
                0.616,
                0.587,
                0.634
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5. SDS-PAGE 时，不同大小蛋白质分子的电荷/质量比值趋近于相同。"
                }
