            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 26,
              "bbox": [
                0.033,
                0.835,
                0.318,
                0.851
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "15. RNA 是基因表达的第一个产物。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 27,
              "bbox": [
                0.033,
                0.853,
                0.418,
                0.869
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "16. 糖苷中的配糖体可以是除糖以外的任何分子。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 28,
              "bbox": [
                0.033,
                0.87,
                0.706,
                0.887
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "17. 非蛋白氮是指血液中除蛋白质外的其他含氮物质所含的氮，其中尿素氮约占75%。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 29,
              "bbox": [
                0.033,
                0.888,
                0.524,
                0.905
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "18. 人体内能使葡萄糖磷酸化的酶是己糖激酶和磷酸果糖激酶。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 30,
          "bbox": [
            0.352,
            0.928,
            0.486,
            0.945
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第2页 共4页"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.092,
            0.955,
            0.318
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 0,
              "bbox": [
                0.105,
                0.092,
                0.528,
                0.109
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "19. 共价调节酶的活性受 ATP 的共价修饰调节。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 1,
              "bbox": [
                0.104,
                0.111,
                0.506,
                0.127
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "20. 线粒体 DNA 复制时需要使用 RNA 引物。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 2,
              "bbox": [
                0.104,
                0.13,
                0.955,
                0.146
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "21. 谷胱甘肽 (Glutathione, GSH) 是一个典型的 3 肽，具有 2 个肽键。一个 α 氨基和一个 α 胶基。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.15,
                0.58,
                0.166
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "22. 脱氧核糖核苷酸中的脱氧核糖直接来源于 dPRPP。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.169,
                0.71,
                0.185
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "23. 由于遗传密码存在简并性，所以每一个氨基酸对应有多个 tRNA。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.187,
                0.953,
                0.203
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "24. 甲硫氨酸（Methionine）含有一个活泼甲基，因此，是机体甲基化反应中甲基的主要直接供体。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.205,
                0.633,
                0.221
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "25. 一个基因 mRNA 的转录通常是从编码链 ATG 处开始的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.224,
                0.795,
                0.24
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "26. 血浆中含有合成蛋白质所需的各种氨基酸，且每种氨基酸的浓度基本一致。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.244,
                0.775,
                0.26
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "27. 核苷酸从头合成的特征不是先合成碱基，然后碱基再与核糖和磷酸结合。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.263,
                0.596,
                0.279
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "28. 氨基酸可以通过脱氨基也可以通过脱羧基进行代谢。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.283,
                0.815,
                0.299
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "29. 多聚腺苷酸聚合酶(Polyadenylate polymerase) 催化 mRNA 加尾时不需要模板。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.302,
                0.895,
                0.318
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "30. 某些氨基酸对人类而言之所以是必需氨基酸，是因为人类不能合成其骨架的碳链部分。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.1,
            0.354,
            0.472,
            0.376
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "三、问答题（每题10分，共90分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.402,
            0.898,
            0.577
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 有 5 种蛋白质， "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "P_{1}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "P_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "P_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "P_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "P_{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，它们的等电点  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "pI_{1}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "pI_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "pI_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "pI_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "pI_{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  大小排序为  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0 \\rightarrow pI_{1} \\rightarrow pI_{2} \\rightarrow pI_{3} \\rightarrow 7.0 \\rightarrow pI_{4} \\rightarrow pI_{5} \\rightarrow 14"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。将含有 5 种蛋白质的混和液各 3ml 分别加入两种不同介质的离子交换层析柱（假定所有缓冲液的 pH 为 7.0，柱床体积为 20ml，能完全吸附带相反电荷的蛋白质），然后使用 NaCl 进行梯度洗脱（两柱洗脱流速相同），紫外检测并记录洗脱曲线如图-1 和图-2。如果洗脱峰用  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "f_{n}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  表示，峰面积用  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "S_{n}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  表示，请回答:（1）哪个图是阳离子交换层析的结果，哪个图是阴离子交换层析的结果？（2）每个洗脱峰各自对应哪些蛋白？（3）理论上，洗脱峰的面积之间有哪些等量关系？（4）哪些蛋白质的等电点最接近？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.107,
            0.587,
            0.825,
            0.694
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.107,
                0.587,
                0.825,
                0.694
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_2_image_15.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.713,
            0.89,
            0.905
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 16,
              "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.713,
                0.729,
                0.732
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 推导单底物酶的 Michaelis-Menten 方程，并说明必要的推导依据。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 17,
              "bbox": [
                0.096,
                0.736,
                0.89,
                0.777
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3. 离子跨膜运输的方式有哪些，各有何特点？举例说明它们是如何维持膜内外正常离子浓度的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 18,
              "bbox": [
                0.095,
                0.795,
                0.889,
                0.833
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4. 核苷酸是细胞合成核酸的原料，在核苷酸的合成过程中，细胞通过何种方式来调节不同核苷酸量的平衡？试分析之。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 19,
              "bbox": [
                0.095,
                0.865,
                0.889,
                0.905
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5. 实验测得天冬氨酸氨基转移酶（Aspartate aminotransferase）是哺乳动物肝脏氨基转移酶中活性最高的，为什么？"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.483,
            0.927,
            0.64,
            0.946
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第3页 共4页"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 3,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.042,
            0.094,
            0.732,
            0.278
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 1,
              "bbox": [
                0.044,
                0.095,
                0.687,
                0.115
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "6. 多肽化学合成和生物学合成的延伸方向是否一致？结合其合成过程进行解释。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 2,
              "bbox": [
                0.043,
                0.137,
                0.73,
                0.178
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "7. 宿主细胞中引入外源 DNA（如质粒）的大量表达通常会导致细胞内部代谢的改变（也称代谢负荷）。试分析代谢负荷对宿主细胞代谢会造成哪些可能的影响？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.043,
                0.2,
                0.569,
                0.22
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "8. 你是否同意 RNA 的不稳定性有利于自然选择的说法，为什么？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.041,
                0.239,
                0.729,
                0.278
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "9. 细胞中的核酸总是与蛋白结合在一起。简述在实验操作中分离和纯化核酸的常用方法及原理。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
